=== Go to church
--- Go to church [title]
overline: The church
heading: Build Up the Church
center: Plug in and pitch in. Build the church of Jesus by building up your local church, and winning souls to Christ.
big: Isaiah 2:3 | mark: Come ye, and let us go up to the mountain of the LORD, to the house of the God of Jacob
center: Him that overcometh will I make a pillar in the temple of my God ([[Revelation 3:12]]).
